WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
This time the event happens online.

2
00:00:04.002 --> 00:00:05.879
It's for the Nigerian brand,

3
00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:07.975
so switch to it first.

4
00:00:09.159 --> 00:00:10.632
Then tap plus,

5
00:00:10.688 --> 00:00:11.934
Create event,

6
00:00:12.036 --> 00:00:14.451
and Ticketed event.

7
00:00:16.647 --> 00:00:20.213
Name it, and set the format to Online.

8
00:00:21.318 --> 00:00:22.792
Pick the party type,

9
00:00:22.792 --> 00:00:25.151
the vibe tags and the genres

10
00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:27.721
amapiano, afro house,

11
00:00:27.721 --> 00:00:28.963
afrobeats.

12
00:00:29.209 --> 00:00:31.044
They all show up as tags

13
00:00:31.044 --> 00:00:32.425
on your event page.

14
00:00:32.983 --> 00:00:35.438
Then a line or two about the night.

15
00:00:42.247 --> 00:00:44.566
Step two: when.

16
00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:47.482
Set the timezone first

17
00:00:47.482 --> 00:00:50.220
search for Lagos and pick it.

18
00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:52.133
Then the date,

19
00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:55.232
and when the stream starts and ends.

20
00:00:55.485 --> 00:00:57.342
It runs past midnight,

21
00:00:57.342 --> 00:00:59.448
and Mingla works out the length.

22
00:01:07.147 --> 00:01:10.542
Step three is a link, not an address.

23
00:01:10.642 --> 00:01:12.828
Only ticket holders see it.

24
00:01:14.347 --> 00:01:16.656
Step four is how it looks.

25
00:01:16.919 --> 00:01:18.451
Add a video cover

26
00:01:18.534 --> 00:01:20.136
we've sped up the upload

27
00:01:20.425 --> 00:01:22.438
then add photos underneath,

28
00:01:22.438 --> 00:01:23.664
up to eight.

29
00:01:24.331 --> 00:01:25.426
Pick a theme:

30
00:01:25.429 --> 00:01:27.497
a colour, a typeface,

31
00:01:27.497 --> 00:01:29.293
and a little motion.

32
00:01:29.657 --> 00:01:32.489
The preview changes as you choose.

33
00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.476
Step five:

34
00:01:54.638 --> 00:01:55.646
tickets.

35
00:01:56.186 --> 00:01:58.858
Name the pass and describe it.

36
00:01:59.174 --> 00:02:01.118
Set the price in naira,

37
00:02:01.138 --> 00:02:02.946
and how many you're selling.

38
00:02:03.632 --> 00:02:05.473
Under Available at,

39
00:02:05.473 --> 00:02:07.535
choose Online only,

40
00:02:07.535 --> 00:02:09.628
so it isn't sold at the door.

41
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:11.712
Add a waitlist,

42
00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.299
allow transfers,

43
00:02:13.362 --> 00:02:14.895
and save.

44
00:02:18.347 --> 00:02:19.609
In settings,

45
00:02:19.609 --> 00:02:20.907
keep it public.

46
00:02:24.547 --> 00:02:26.505
Step seven shows the event

47
00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:28.383
the way guests will see it.

48
00:02:28.711 --> 00:02:32.099
Publish, and sales open straight away.

49
00:02:36.147 --> 00:02:37.778
And it's live,

50
00:02:37.778 --> 00:02:38.844
with the cover,

51
00:02:38.866 --> 00:02:42.107
your photos and an Online tag.

52
00:02:42.661 --> 00:02:45.475
Every customer Mingla drives your way

53
00:02:45.475 --> 00:02:47.182
lands right here.
